  "description": "We are a small family-owned business founded in 2015. For many years we’ve been fans of organic and farm products, and we are trying to popularise the idea that you need to eat consciously. We started off with a small gastro-boutique that was situated in a quiet and green area of ​​Moscow. Over, the next few years we gained more experience and evolved. Now, Botteganova Organic is a cozy restaurant with Italian cuisine, where families, friends, relatives, loved ones meet, and, of course, make new pleasant acquaintances. Here, the mouth-watering aroma of sweet Uzbek tomatoes is mixed with the exciting and invigorating taste of cappuccino and espresso, brewed with Italian roasted coffee beans. Here you can obtain a unique gastronomic experience and make sure that a healthy lifestyle is neither fashion nor luxury, but philosophy, style, necessity. Now we also offer EV charging. There are two plugs available for our clients with electric vehicles for a little fee",
